#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:6
msgid "Project Creation & Management"
msgstr "项目创建与管理"

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:8
msgid "Application Project Location"
msgstr "应用程序项目位置"

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:10
msgid ""
"UniSDK application projects **can be located in any directory**, not "
"limited to the `samples/` directory. Each application project needs to "
"provide its own `CMakeLists.txt` and source code."
msgstr ""
"UniSDK 应用程序项目**可以放在任何目录中**，不限于 `samples/` 目录。每个应用程序项目需要提供自己的 `CMakeLists.txt` 和源代码。"

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:12
msgid "Creating a New Project"
msgstr "创建新项目"

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md
#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:14
msgid "Minimum Project Structure"
msgstr "最小项目结构"

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:27
msgid "CMakeLists.txt Template"
msgstr "CMakeLists.txt 模板"

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:51
msgid "Key Notes"
msgstr "关键说明"

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:53
msgid ""
"**`find_package(Telink)`** — Locates the SDK path via the `TELINK_BASE` "
"environment variable"
msgstr ""
"**`find_package(Telink)`** — 通过 `TELINK_BASE` 环境变量定位 SDK 路径"

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:54
msgid ""
"**`project()`** — The project name will be used as the output firmware "
"name"
msgstr ""
"**`project()`** — 项目名称将用作输出的固件名称"

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:55
msgid ""
"**`target_sources(Telink ...)`** — Application source files are added to "
"the SDK's main target `Telink`"
msgstr ""
"**`target_sources(Telink ...)`** — 应用程序源文件被添加到 SDK 的主目标 `Telink` 中"

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:56
msgid ""
"**`CONFIG_TLK_ALLOW_CPP_WRAPPERS`** — Checks whether C++ wrappers are "
"enabled"
msgstr ""
"**`CONFIG_TLK_ALLOW_CPP_WRAPPERS`** — 检查是否启用了 C++ 包装器"

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:58
msgid "Building the Project"
msgstr "构建项目"

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:60
msgid "West Command (Recommended)"
msgstr "West 命令（推荐）"

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:70
msgid "CMake Command"
msgstr "CMake 命令"

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:80
msgid "Make Command"
msgstr "Make 命令"

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:86
msgid "Configuration Management"
msgstr "配置管理"

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:88
msgid "Using Project Kconfig"
msgstr "使用项目 Kconfig"

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:90
msgid ""
"Create a `Kconfig` file in the project directory to define project-"
"specific configuration options:"
msgstr ""
"在项目目录中创建 `Kconfig` 文件，定义项目特定的配置选项："

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:104
msgid ""
"The `Kconfig` file is automatically integrated into the build system via "
"`KCONFIG_APPLICATION_DIR` in `kconfig.cmake`."
msgstr ""
"`Kconfig` 文件通过 `kconfig.cmake` 中的 `KCONFIG_APPLICATION_DIR` 自动集成到构建系统中。"

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:106
msgid "Interactive Configuration"
msgstr "交互式配置"

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:112
msgid "Cleaning"
msgstr "清理"

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:122
msgid "Development Workflow Recommendations"
msgstr "开发工作流程建议"

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:124
msgid ""
"**Start from a sample** — Copy the most similar `samples/` example as a "
"starting point"
msgstr ""
"**从示例开始** — 复制最相似的 `samples/` 示例作为起点"

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:125
msgid ""
"**Kconfig isolation** — Place project-specific configuration in the "
"project-level `Kconfig`"
msgstr ""
"**Kconfig 隔离** — 将项目特定的配置放在项目级别的 `Kconfig` 中"

#: ../../source/developing/project_management.md:126
msgid ""
"**Version management** — Manage application projects and the SDK "
"separately, linking them via `TELINK_BASE`"
msgstr ""
"**版本管理** — 将应用程序项目和 SDK 分开管理，通过 `TELINK_BASE` 链接它们"
